sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Buyer client
  participant F as Security + RateLimit filters
  participant K as ClaimController
  participant S as ClaimService
  participant R as Redis (Lua)
  participant P as PostgreSQL
  participant X as Outbox relay
  participant Q as Kafka
  participant W as OrderWorker
  participant G as Payment gateway

  C->>F: POST /api/v1/sales/{id}/claims (JWT, Idempotency-Key)
  F->>F: token bucket per user and global
  alt limit exceeded
    F-->>C: 429 Too Many Requests
  end
  F->>K: forward
  K->>S: claim(saleId, userId, key)
  S->>R: EVALSHA reserve.lua
  alt sold out / duplicate
    R-->>S: -1 or -2
    S-->>K: SOLD_OUT / DUPLICATE
    K-->>C: 409 problem+json
  else accepted
    R-->>S: 1 (hold written, TTL)
    S->>P: one tx - insert reservation PENDING and outbox row, commit
    alt DB failure
      S->>R: EVALSHA release.lua (compensate)
      K-->>C: 503 Retry-After
    end
    S-->>K: ACCEPTED(reservationId, expiresAt)
    K-->>C: 202 Accepted
  end
  X->>P: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
  X->>Q: produce ReservationAccepted (key = reservationId)
  X->>P: UPDATE outbox SET published_at
  Q->>W: poll
  W->>G: charge(saved payment method)
  alt payment ok
    W->>P: insert order ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING, reservation CONFIRMED
  else payment failed
    W->>P: reservation RELEASED
    W->>R: release.lua (unit back to stock)
  end
  W->>Q: ack offset
